ree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2670},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"644af568545998ef8e7cbe91beab3c23","originalFileName":"8a39ea3d-b917-44a8-a989-5b08fd3c6270-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":56005},"type":"attachment"}],"parameters":[],"start":1791926950694,"stop":1791926950694,"duration":0,"type":"step","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"stepId":"20933cad6e27b728b1eb84f3fc1a54a2","name":"(backend): Pass","status":"passed","steps":[],"parameters":[],"start":1791926950694,"stop":1791926950694,"duration":0,"type":"step","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"stepId":"9c042b197e57d14a479b4f56253a4abd","name":"Manual: Q1: where QA Hosp Patel sits in the picker opened on his room's box, and whether he is marked: read s05-picker-room.png","status":"skipped","steps":[],"parameters":[],"start":1791926950694,"stop":1791926950694,"duration":0,"type":"step","message":"Not automated in this run: a person checks it.","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"link":{"id":"3e7fc53286b35a33dbc7d29c3881ad7b","originalFileName":"6ddbf165-3058-4c33-83d2-df2825f539b5-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"agent's notes (facts it saw, not a verdict)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":976},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"71e0390834a19126dc94018ae65d316d","originalFileName":"89ab82e9-5eda-4b20-83cd-e5b3d0db045b-attachment.json","ext":".json","name":"oracle verdict","contentType":"application/json","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2830},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #14): Pass — room chip + 'Matches on your list' suggestion for Bed/Room/Rm/bare numbers, none without a room, name match; nothing auto-assigns; assign appends verbatim"},"testCase":{"id":"e810da89ff12ae41d3ff3c7a462b3fb7","externalId":"8b63523e8f75aeee47b8572012f20706","name":"[dev] S05 Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened on a room box","fullName":"TC-04 Quick Dictation (Hospital only; TC-05 Rounding Sheet merged in) › TC-04/S05"},"descriptionHtml":"<p><b>Case priority: P0 · stated in the UAT / ticket AC</b> · UAT TC-04 Expected; TFA-92582 AC 2, AC 4 · “never routes by name or room”. Mixed: stated part — 'bed 415' shows a chip and suggests the patient; a name never routes the box; nothing reaches a chart without a tap; our part — Other room phrasings ('Room', 'Rm. #', a bare number) treated like 'bed 415' (only the stated part makes a QA bug).</p><div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>Approach</b> · TC-04 Quick Dictation (Hospital only; TC-05 Rounding Sheet merged in) · <b>S05</b> Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened on a room box</p><p><b>UAT steps / ticket ACs covered:</b></p><ul><li><b>U3</b> A box that starts with a room number (e.g. 'bed 415…') shows a room chip, and the picker suggests that room's patient. The physician still taps to assign; nothing auto-assigns. (UAT TC-04; TFA-92582 AC 4; TFA-92582 step 4; TFA-92583 AC 3)</li><li><b>U6</b> No auto-assignment anywhere: the app never splits one dictation across patients, never routes by name or room, and never merges boxes. There is no AI routing. (UAT TC-04; TFA-92582 AC 2; TFA-92583 AC 2)</li></ul><p><b>Test design technique: </b>Equivalence classes (equivalence) — Check the same rule again with another class of input (Hospital / Nursing Home, other data); every class has to be right.</p><p><b>Given </b>QA Hosp Patel in room 415, QA Hosp Ortiz in room 416</p><p><b>When </b>Type into one box, replacing the text each time: 'bed 415 seen at 7, comfortable.' (then open Assign to patient on it and close the picker), 'Room 415: pain 3/10, on oral analgesia.', 'Rm. #415 — dressing changed.', '415 — afebrile, eating breakfast.', 'Looks better this morning, lungs clear.', 'QA Hosp Ortiz looks be …</p><p><b>Then </b>Each of the four room forms shows the chip and suggests Patel; the picker opened on the room box lists Patel (where he sits is recorded for Q1); the no-room text and the name-only text show no chip and no suggestion, and the name never routes the box to Ortiz; no text reaches either chart without a tap</p><p><b>Pass rule (oracle, excerpt): </b>oracle.mjs: cp1 and cp3–cp5 mustContain 'Rm 415' and '415 · QA Hosp Patel', mustNotContain 'Re-assign' (U3). cp2 (picker open on the room box) mustContain 'Assign to patient', 'Search room or name', '415 · QA Hosp Patel', mustNotContain 'Re-assign'; Patel's place in the list and any mark are recorded for Q1. cp6 mustNotContain 'Rm 415' and 'Matches on your list'. …</p><p><b>Where it ran: </b>dev unit U14; test method AGENT · Browser agent; lane planned in the matrix: browser agent (blocked)</p><p><small>S05 is our own case number (its number in the coverage matrix cases/TC-04.matrix.json), not a step number of the UAT document.</small></p></div><p><b>Environment: dev</b> — dev deployment, build <code>8b4be94</code> (Deploy Convex, 2026-10-19T17:04:37Z); account and address are not written into the report; run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>.</p><p><b>Test method:</b> AGENT · Browser agent — as classified in cases/test-methods.json, which says it runs on both; Source: <code>dev</code>.</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-04 Quick Dictation (Hospital only; TC-05 Rounding Sheet merged in) · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-04/S05</p><p><b>Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened on a room box</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92582 Quick Dictation (ready for qa); TFA-92583 Rounding Sheet (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>generated/tc04s05/verdict.json</code>). Agent: 43 turns, 124 s, $0.23.</p><p><b>Recorded (evidence only):</b></p><ul><li>s05-picker-room.md: (Q1: where Patel sits in the picker opened on his room's box) pass: in order: &quot;415 · QA TC-04-S05 QA Hosp Patel LS0A&quot; &lt; &quot;416 · QA TC-04-S05 QA Hosp Ortiz LS0A&quot; (in from &quot;Search room or name&quot;)</li></ul><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U14 (#14, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Quick Dictation: room phrasing classes. Quick Dictation compartments belong to the account; quickDictation:list counts.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #14, U14; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — room chip + 'Matches on your list' suggestion for Bed/Room/Rm/bare numbers, none without a room, name match; nothing auto-assigns; assign appends verbatim</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-04 Quick Dictation (Hospital only; TC-05 Rounding Sheet merged in)","S05 Room phrasing classes: 'bed', 'Room', 'Rm. #', bare number, no room, a name only; the picker opened…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"3e758757ac530e568b6937c4808e36f1","originalFileName":"452018af-0fab-4886-8996-38eac2b914b4-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":4072,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"bcd4e86e281526dd46b8a488e6af45c7","originalFileName":"7b574a36-af5c-4dba-8d1a-657a082821db-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":37568},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"ce334cfe440f5120e1cf06f1dd0f224b","originalFileName":"25e6dbb9-ba66-4cf7-b0fb-e805ec9f730d-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":4451,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"e48c6d4274a1a3d7b8297ef9268447d1","originalFileName":"3f54a378-334f-4ed3-8afa-49ba9ed2e092-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"imag